  "decision_conditions": [
    "As the proposed air source heat pump would be installed close to a highway and in absence of information to confirm the volume of the air source heat pump's outdoors compressor unit, the proposal is considered to be contrary to Paragraphs G.1 (j)(ii) and (d), of Class G, Part 2, Schedule 14 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).",
    "Insufficient and inaccurate information has been submitted to demonstrate that the proposed solar panels would not be installed on a wall which fronts a highway, contrary to Paragraph A.1 (c), of Class A, Part 2, Schedule 14 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended)."
  ],
